			"zh": "一场车祸"
		},
		{
			"i": 2,
			"start": 5.54,
			"end": 11.24,
			"en": "Listen to the tape then answer this question.",
			"zh": "听录音，然后回答这个问题。"
		},
		{
			"i": 3,
			"start": 11.39,
			"end": 17.24,
			"en": "Can the mechanics repair Mr. Wood's car?",
			"zh": "机械师能修好伍德先生的车吗？"
		},
		{
			"i": 4,
			"start": 17.39,
			"end": 19.97,
			"en": "Is my car ready yet?",
			"zh": "我的车修好了吗？"
		},
		{
			"i": 5,
			"start": 20.12,
			"end": 22.12,
			"en": "I don't know, sir.",
			"zh": "我不知道，先生。"
		},
		{
			"i": 6,
			"start": 22.27,
			"end": 25.42,
			"en": "What's the number of your car?",
			"zh": "您的车牌号是多少？"
		},
		{
			"i": 7,
			"start": 25.57,
			"end": 32.03,
			"en": "It's LFZ 312 G.",
			"zh": "是 LFZ 312 G。"
		},
		{
			"i": 8,
			"start": 32.18,
			"end": 35.25,
			"en": "When did you bring it to us?",
			"zh": "您什么时候把它送来的？"
		},
		{
			"i": 9,
			"start": 35.4,
			"end": 38.96,
			"en": "I brought it here three days ago.",
			"zh": "我三天前把它送来的。"
		},
		{
			"i": 10,
			"start": 39.11,
			"end": 42.8,
			"en": "Ah yes, I remember now.",
			"zh": "啊，是的，我现在想起来了。"
		},
		{
			"i": 11,
			"start": 42.95,
			"end": 46.12,
			"en": "Have your mechanics finished yet?",
			"zh": "您的机械师修好了吗？"
		},
		{
			"i": 12,
			"start": 46.27,
			"end": 49.41,
			"en": "No, they're still working on it.",
			"zh": "没有，他们还在修。"
		},
		{
			"i": 13,
			"start": 49.56,
			"end": 55.61,
			"en": "Let's go into the garage and have a look at it.",
			"zh": "我们去车库看看吧。"
		},
		{
			"i": 14,
			"start": 55.76,
			"end": 58.6,
			"en": "Isn't that your car?",
			"zh": "那不是你的车吗？"
		},
		{
			"i": 15,
			"start": 58.75,
			"end": 62.39,
			"en": "Well, it was my car.",
			"zh": "嗯，那是我的车。"
		},
		{
			"i": 16,
			"start": 62.54,
			"end": 65.08,
			"en": "Didn't you have a crash?",
			"zh": "你没有出车祸吗？"
		},
		{
			"i": 17,
			"start": 65.23,
			"end": 66.8,
			"en": "That's right.",
			"zh": "是的。"
		},
		{
			"i": 18,
			"start": 66.95,
			"end": 70.25,
			"en": "I drove it into a lamp-post.",
			"zh": "我把它撞到了路灯柱上。"
		},
		{
			"i": 19,
			"start": 70.4,
			"end": 73.39,
			"en": "Can your mechanics repair it?",
			"zh": "你的机械师能修好它吗？"
		},
		{
			"i": 20,
			"start": 73.54,
			"end": 76.87,
			"en": "Well, they're trying to repair it, sir.",
			"zh": "嗯，先生，他们正在努力修。"
		},
		{
			"i": 21,
			"start": 77.02,
			"end": 81.02,
			"en": "But to tell you the truth, you need a new car!",
			"zh": "但说实话，你需要一辆新车了！"
		}
	]
}
